nature Pass  \n ansen-changan, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:14+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:14+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161491976,"discussion_id":"30d8ee0b54dd51661785cc6115737f90c9ccb5fc","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161492059,"discussion_id":"66aef3f1ab9e875d6bc031b30d0aedeea6621dc5","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了Flash Attention梯度计算后处理模块中的一个关键Bug。原代码在处理NZ（非零）输入格式下，计算梯度累加和`dsink`时存在符号错误，导致`sink`标志为1时的计算结果不准确。此修复确保了梯度累加和计算的数学正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`FlashAttentionScoreGradPost`模板类中针对两种特定Tiling数据类型的特化实现。核心修复包括两点：1）将内部累加操作`dsinkCalc -= vecOut.GetValue(0)`更正为`+=`；2）将最终写入全局内存的值从`dsinkCalc`更正为`-dsinkCalc`。该方案确保了从工作空间数据块中求和得到的结果，在写入最终输出时符号正确。","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:40+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:40+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161492318,"discussion_id":"caedb71e5ba5091b9d9a4f57a7e7edcbf40abe08","body":"### 逻辑错误: 在计算 dsinkCalc 时，从原来的减法操作（dsinkCalc = - vecOut.GetValue(0)）改为加法操作（dsinkCalc += vecOut.GetValue(0)），但后续的 dsinkGm.SetValue(n1temp, -dsinkCalc) 仍然对 dsinkCalc 取负。这导致最终结果与原始逻辑不一致。原始逻辑中，每次迭代都取负值累加，最终结果直接赋值；新逻辑中，每次迭代累加正值，最终结果再取负。虽然数学上可能等价，但需要确认这种改变是否符合业务逻辑和数值精度要求。\n\n**问题类型**: 逻辑错误\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_kernel/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_post.h`\n**行号**: 843\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\ndsinkCalc += vecOut.GetValue(0);\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n如果业务逻辑要求最终结果为负的累加和，应保持原逻辑不变，即改为 dsinkCalc -= vecOut.GetValue(0); 或 dsinkCalc = dsinkCalc - vecOut.GetValue(0);。如果新逻辑是预期的，请添加注释说明为何改变计算方式，并确保所有相关代码（包括其他特化版本）同步更新。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:03:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:09:40+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":843,"end_new_line":843,"start_old_line":843,"end_old_line":843,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161492332,"discussion_id":"c3be1c76404bd9cfa61c2c28324e3c1cdb70968c","body":"### 逻辑错误: dsinkGm.SetValue(n1temp, -dsinkCalc) 在 dsinkCalc 已改为累加正值后，再次取负，可能导致符号错误。需要结合上下文确认最终期望的符号。\n\n**问题类型**: 逻辑错误\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_kernel/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_post.h`\n**行号**: 848\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\ndsinkGm.SetValue(n1temp, -dsinkCalc);\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n根据业务逻辑调整：如果期望最终存储负累加和，且 dsinkCalc 已累加正值，则此处取负正确；如果期望存储正累加和，则应改为 dsinkGm.SetValue(n1temp, dsinkCalc);。建议明确注释最终值的符号含义。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成